#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:10
msgid "All documentation is reStructuredText under ``docs/``. The only Markdown files are each crate's ``README.md``, a short cheat sheet, and the files GitHub needs at the root. Design notes, internals, ledgers and conformance tables are pages under ``docs/manual/internals``."
